  m_text: 'CoreBuster was made by Cosmic Studios for COMP307 Graphics & Modelling.


    Generative
    AI tools assisted with parts of this game''s code, shaders, procedural art and
    documentation. Every idea, design decision and piece of guidance given to the
    AI was our own, and the team reviewed, tested and integrated everything it produced.


    Some
    models, textures, sounds and interface art come from third-party asset packs,
    used under their licences.'
